# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it was generated
# by a real `terraform init` against the public Terraform registry (see
# docs/ecs/infrastructure-architecture.md "Validated, not applied") and is
# committed so provider versions stay reproducible across machines/CI.
